# src-tauri/libs/mpv/ — runtime libmpv artifacts (downloaded, never committed).
#
# The setup_runtime_libs_* scripts populate this directory with the pre-built
# libmpv dylib/so/dll + headers from fyom-org/fork-mpv. The .checksum file is
# the only tracked artifact; everything else is gitignored.
# Keep the .checksum pin + the .gitkeep-style directory entry; ignore binaries.
*
!/.gitignore
!/.checksum
